  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Healthy_Water/MP_HEALTHY_WATER_Header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"627\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">這是一款旨在提升遊戲體驗的簡單模組，它加入了我們從一開始就擁有的新型食物——我們摯愛的水！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">現在，玩家可以用簡單的玻璃罐裝水，飲用後能恢復半格飢餓值與半顆心的生命值。就是這麼簡單！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要與朋友同樂的伺服器嗎？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Healthy_Water/MP_HEALTHY_WATER_Promo.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"285\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">若您正在尋找能與朋友遊玩任何模組或模組包的伺服器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong>正是您的解答！他們提供性價比最高的《Minecraft》伺服器，點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>並使用代碼「Lupin」即可享25%折扣。</span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Healthy_Water/MP_HEALTHY_WATER_Summary.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"168\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">有什麼比喝水更基本的事？實際上，在多數電玩遊戲中都能喝水，且通常會獲得些許獎勵……現在《Minecraft》也能做到了！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">飲水後，您將恢復半格飢餓值與半顆心的生命值！常言道生存必須喝水……雖然這不是強制要求，但絕對能助您一臂之力！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjason13official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860325/description_e69745c8-b22d-4d0d-a55e-5c131ae1fe50.webp\" alt=\"Jason13 Ko-Fi\" width=\"286\" height=\"73\"></span></span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Healthy_Water/MP_HEALTHY_WATER_Faq.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"169\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>適用於伺服器嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然！運作完全正常！請記住，與朋友遊玩模組的最佳方式是透過BisectHosting，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>點擊此連結可享25%折扣</strong></a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此模組可用於模組包嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！但僅限發布於Modrinth或CurseForge平台。上傳至其他平台將侵犯我們的權利，絕不允許。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">然而，若您考慮將本模組加入您的Modrinth或CurseForge模組包，我們將不勝感激。如需任何微調或有疑問，歡迎聯繫我們！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以在頻道錄製此模組的影片嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然，歡迎自由遊玩此模組或我們的任何模組包並製作影片，事實上我們會非常感謝！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Healthy_Water/MP_HEALTHY_WATER_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"169\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/284/healthy-water-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1027\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/285/healthy-water-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1027\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/287/healthy-water-5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1027\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></span></p>",
